{"path":"/documentation/intervention/cache","section":"documentation","title":"cache","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.intervention.cache","label":"cache","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry","label":"Entry\n\n\n  \n      dataclass","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache","label":"Cache","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView","label":"CacheView","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">cache</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Record module activations during a trace with <code>tracer.cache()</code>.</p>\n<p>A cache observes the values flowing past the interleaver and keeps the ones for\nthe modules you asked for. Unlike reading a single location with <code>.output</code>, a\ncache captures <em>every</em> selected module across the whole run — every layer, and\n(in a generation loop) every step::</p>"},{"type":"code","lang":"text","code":"with model.trace(prompt) as tracer:\n    cache = tracer.cache()                       # every module's output\ncache[\"model.transformer.h.0\"].output            # by path\ncache.transformer.h[0].output                    # or by navigation"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Because the interleaver already funnels every module input/output through\n<a title=\"            handle\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/interleaver#nnsight.intervention.interleaver.Interleaver.handle\"><code>handle</code></a> (applying\ninterventions first), a cache is just a post-intervention observer: it needs no\nper-module controllers of its own. Navigation and alias/index resolution are delegated to the\nmodel's <a title=\"            Envoy\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/envoy#nnsight.intervention.envoy.Envoy\"><code>Envoy</code></a> tree, so a <a title=\"            CacheView\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView\"><code>CacheView</code></a>\nstays thin and aliases / <code>ModuleList</code> indexing work for free.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">Entry</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-dataclass\"><code>dataclass</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"Entry(output: Any = None, inputs: tuple[tuple[Any, ...], dict[str, Any]] | None = None)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>One visit to a module: its output and/or its inputs.</p>\n<p>A module visited more than once in a run (e.g. a generation loop) produces\none <a title=\"            Entry\n\n\n  \n      dataclass\n  \" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry\"><code>Entry</code></a> per visit; see <a title=\"            CacheView\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView\"><code>CacheView</code></a>.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry.output\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">output</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"output: Any = None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry.inputs\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">inputs</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"inputs: tuple[tuple[Any, ...], dict[str, Any]] | None = None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry.input\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">input</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"input: Any"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>The first input — the first positional argument, else the first keyword.</p>\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">Cache</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"Cache(model: Envoy, modules: list[Envoy | str] | None = None, device: device | None = device('cpu'), dtype: dtype | None = None, detach: bool = True, include_output: bool = True, include_inputs: bool = False, non_blocking: bool = False)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Records selected modules' activations as the run reaches them.</p>\n<p>Created by <a title=\"            cache\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/tracer#nnsight.intervention.tracer.InterleavingTracer.cache\"><code>cache</code></a> and\nregistered on the calling mediator, so <a title=\"            observe\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.observe\"><code>observe</code></a> is fed every location\nthe run reaches (post-intervention). Values for the selected module paths are\nstored in <a title=\"            entries\n\n\n  \n      instance-attribute\n  \" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.entries\"><code>entries</code></a> — one list of <a title=\"            Entry\n\n\n  \n      dataclass\n  \" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry\"><code>Entry</code></a> per module path, an\nentry appended per visit.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">ATTRIBUTE</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td><code><a title=\"            model\n\n\n  \n      instance-attribute\n   (nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.model)\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.model\">model</a></code></td>\n            <td class=\"doc-attribute-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The root envoy, used to resolve paths / aliases for <a title=\"            CacheView\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView\"><code>CacheView</code></a>.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td><code><a title=\"            targets\n\n\n  \n      instance-attribute\n   (nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.targets)\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.targets\">targets</a></code></td>\n            <td class=\"doc-attribute-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>The module paths to keep, or <code>None</code> to keep every module.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-attribute-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"set\">set</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>] | None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td><code><a title=\"            entries\n\n\n  \n      instance-attribute\n   (nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.entries)\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.entries\">entries</a></code></td>\n            <td class=\"doc-attribute-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Recorded values, <code>{module_path: [Entry, ...]}</code>.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-attribute-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"dict\">dict</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>, <span title=\"list\">list</span>[<a title=\"            Entry\n\n\n  \n      dataclass\n   (nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry)\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Entry\">Entry</a>]]</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.model\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">model</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"model = model"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.device\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">device</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"device = device"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.dtype\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">dtype</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"dtype = dtype"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.detach\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">detach</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"detach = detach"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.non_blocking\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">non_blocking</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"non_blocking = non_blocking"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.include_output\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">include_output</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"include_output = include_output"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.include_inputs\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">include_inputs</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"include_inputs = include_inputs"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.targets\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">targets</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"targets: set[str] | None = None if modules is None else {m if isinstance(m, str) else m.path for m in modules}"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.entries\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">entries</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"entries: dict[str, list[Entry]] = {}"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.__getstate__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__getstate__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__getstate__() -> dict"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.wants\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">wants</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"wants(location: str) -> bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Whether this cache would record <code>location</code>.</p>\n<p>The same question <a title=\"            observe\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.observe\"><code>observe</code></a>\nanswers by recording, asked without recording — for a caller that has to\ndo work <em>before</em> the value can be offered, and only wants to do it for\nlocations some cache actually keeps (see\n<a title=\"            TPFragments\" href=\"/documentation/modeling/tp/fragments#nnsight.modeling.tp.fragments.TPFragments\"><code>TPFragments</code></a>, which\nmust run a collective first). Shares <code>_select</code> with <code>observe</code> so the two\ncan't drift.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.subscriptions\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">subscriptions</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"subscriptions() -> 'dict[str, tuple[str, str]]'"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Every location this cache keeps, named before the model starts.</p>\n<p>The interleaver routes a value straight to the caches subscribed to its\nlocation, so a cache has to know its locations up front: an explicit\nmodule list names them, and <code>modules=None</code> means every module in the\ntree, read off the model here.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.observe\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">observe</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"observe(location: str, value: Any) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Record <code>value</code> if <code>location</code> is a selected module's input/output.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.observe_selected\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">observe_selected</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"observe_selected(selected: tuple[str, str], value: Any) -> None"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Record a location the interleaver has already selected.</p>\n<p>This is the fast counterpart to <a title=\"            observe\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache.observe\"><code>observe</code></a>:\nan explicit-target cache receives its <code>(path, slot)</code> subscription from\nthe interleaver, so there is no second provider-string parse on the hot\npath.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">CacheView</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"CacheView(cache: Cache, envoy: Envoy | None, path: str | None = None)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Path- and attribute-addressable view over a <a title=\"            Cache\" href=\"#nnsight.intervention.cache.Cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>'s entries.</p>\n<p>The object returned by <code>tracer.cache()</code>. Read a module's captured value\nwith <code>.output</code> / <code>.inputs</code> / <code>.input</code> after selecting it, either by path\n(<code>cache[\"model.transformer.h.0\"]</code>) or by navigating the tree\n(<code>cache.model.transformer.h[0]</code> — or the short <code>cache.transformer.h[0]</code>).\nNavigation is resolved against the model's envoy tree, so renamed modules and\n<code>ModuleList</code> indices resolve the same way they do on the model\n(<code>cache.model.transformer.h[\"second_layer\"]</code> works when <code>1</code> is renamed\n<code>second_layer</code>). When a module was visited multiple times (a generation\nloop), <code>len(view)</code> is the visit count and <code>.output</code> returns the list.</p>\n<p>The object handed back is a <em>virtual root</em> above the model: its child is the\nmodel itself, reached by the model's name (<code>cache.model</code>), mirroring the\nfull paths used as keys. <code>_envoy</code> is <code>None</code> there and a real envoy at every\nnode below.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.output\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">output</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"output: Any"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.inputs\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">inputs</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"inputs: Any"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.input\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">input</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-property\"><code>property</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"input: Any"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.keys\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">keys</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"keys() -> list[str]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>The cached module paths at or below this view's node (all, at the root).</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.__getattr__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__getattr__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__getattr__(name: str) -> CacheView"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.__getitem__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__getitem__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__getitem__(key: str | int) -> CacheView"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.__contains__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__contains__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__contains__(key: str) -> bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.__len__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__len__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__len__() -> int"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.intervention.cache.CacheView.__repr__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">__repr__</span>\n\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__repr__() -> str"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n\n    </div>"}]}